dsh-web-search-opencode
=======================

This product includes software derived from:

  dsh-web-search-opencode
  https://github.com/FANXING-0710/dsh-web-search-opencode
  Copyright (c) FANXING-0710
  Declared license: MIT (in package.json and README.md; the repository ships
  no standalone LICENSE file).

Derived portions: the Exa / Parallel MCP JSON-RPC protocol replication and the
result parsers (Exa block layout, Parallel JSON layout, line scanner) in
lib/provider.js.

Original additions in this package: quota-aware failover across both backends,
own-line URL filtering for citeable sources, error-detail extraction, the
dependency-free package layout (Standard Schema Config, structural WebError),
and the test and smoke suites.

